          "explanation": "Hardware receives 75/125 * 100k = $60,000 (recognized at point in time). Cloud receives 50/125 * 100k = $40,000 (recognized over 24 months, so 12 months in Year 1 = $20,000). Total Year 1 revenue = $80,000."
